  "releaseNotes": "OpenMaui 11.0.10.1:\n- MAUI 11.0.10\n- Third-party libraries on their .NET 11 releases\n- `IView.Visibility` is the effective visibility (MAUI 11.0.10)\n- Screen readers (AT-SPI2)\n- Keyboard and screen-reader access to CommunityToolkit's Expander header\n- `SfSignaturePad.LoadFromStrokeData`\n- A TouchBehavior or gesture recognizer on a Button or ImageButton never fired\n- SfScheduler's desktop resource view on Syncfusion 35\n- A tap or gesture handler that changed the view's gesture recognizers threw\n- A shape without a Stroke was inset by its StrokeThickness (MAUI 11.0.10)\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/open-maui/maui-linux/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
